    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1304">

                <pb facs="1558" n="1360" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1360"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Department of the Army Files: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1304<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Chairman of the Interim
                        Committee</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of War</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stimson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-17">17 July [19]45</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">War</hi>–33556. TopSec Secretary of War from
                    Harrison.</p>
                <p>Doctor has just returned most enthusiastic and confident that the <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Little Boy</hi> is as husky as his big
                        brother.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1304-f1"/> The light in his<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d1304-f2"/> eyes discernible <pb facs="1559" n="1361"
                        xml:id="pg1361"/> from here to Highhold<anchor n="1a" xml:id="d1304-f3"/>
                    and I could have heard his screams from here to my farm.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d1304-f4"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1304-f1" n="1" xml:id="d1304-f1-content">
                <p>i. e., <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fat Man</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1304-f2" n="1" xml:id="d1304-f2-content">
                <p>i. e., <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fat Man</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1304-f3" n="1a" xml:id="d1304-f3-content">
                <p>Stimson’s home on Long Island.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1304-f4" n="2" xml:id="d1304-f4-content">
                <p>At Upperville, Virginia.</p>
                <p>Stimson’s diary entry for July 18 includes the following: “Harrison’s second
                    message came, giving a few of the far reaching details of the test. I at once
                    took it to the President who was highly delighted. … The President was evidently
                    very greatly reenforced over the message from Harrison and said he was very glad
                    I had come to the meeting. …”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
